1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
First Episode
The Princess Knight

15
00:01:58,701 --> 00:02:02,216
- Another exercise! Now!
- Yes, right away, Prince!

16
00:02:02,261 --> 00:02:04,013
Here you go!

17
00:02:09,101 --> 00:02:11,774
Admirable!
All five on target!

18
00:02:12,021 --> 00:02:14,012
But not in the center, though.

19
00:02:14,061 --> 00:02:16,017
Well, I will try again.

20
00:02:16,301 --> 00:02:17,814
Here goes!

21
00:02:23,221 --> 00:02:25,735
You hit the center,
this time!

22
00:02:27,181 --> 00:02:30,617
No! The arrow that hit
the center is not mine.

23
00:02:30,661 --> 00:02:32,413
Oh, heavens!

24
00:02:36,421 --> 00:02:39,697
Whose is it?
I can't make out who it is.

25
00:02:40,501 --> 00:02:43,015
I'll go see.
Go, Opal!

26
00:02:49,021 --> 00:02:51,216
He left some directions.

27
00:03:13,581 --> 00:03:15,333
Hello, Sapphire!

28
00:03:16,221 --> 00:03:18,098
Show yourself!

29
00:03:20,141 --> 00:03:22,939
- Prince Frank!
- Sorry about that arrow,

30
00:03:22,981 --> 00:03:25,620
but I wanted to see you
without other people around

31
00:03:26,501 --> 00:03:29,937
Today you seem more than ever
in an excellent mood, Princess!

32
00:03:29,981 --> 00:03:32,017
I already told you
that I am not a Princess!

33
00:03:32,061 --> 00:03:34,370
- I am a Prince!
- No one can hear us,

34
00:03:34,421 --> 00:03:37,254
so there is no need to
hide the truth, Princess.

35
00:03:37,301 --> 00:03:39,735
how do I have to tell you
that I am a boy?!

36
00:03:39,781 --> 00:03:41,612
Absolutely a boy!

37
00:03:41,661 --> 00:03:43,572
Now listen, take this

38
00:03:43,621 --> 00:03:46,897
This is a pen! Why did you give it
to me? What do you want me to do with it?

39
00:03:47,021 --> 00:03:50,491
You've got the pen.
Now I will give you the ink.

40
00:03:50,541 --> 00:03:52,930
Since you claim
to be a boy,

41
00:03:52,981 --> 00:03:55,336
be so kind as
to put it in writing for me.

42
00:03:55,381 --> 00:03:57,292
For what reason should I do it?

43
00:03:57,341 --> 00:03:59,650
That pen, in reality,
is a magic pen.

44
00:03:59,701 --> 00:04:01,020
Do as I told you!

45
00:04:01,061 --> 00:04:04,019
"I declare that Prince Sapphire
is a boy".

46
00:04:04,061 --> 00:04:06,336
Do you think you wrote
that Sapphire is a boy?

47
00:04:06,381 --> 00:04:08,292
Reread carefully
what you wrote.

48
00:04:08,541 --> 00:04:10,736
"Sapphire is a girl"... Eh?!

49
00:04:11,901 --> 00:04:14,813
Did you see? You yourself wrote
that you are a girl!

50
00:04:14,861 --> 00:04:18,092
How strange! And yet I'm sure I
wrote that I am a boy.

51
00:04:18,421 --> 00:04:21,538
I'll try again.
"Sapphire is a boy".

52
00:04:21,901 --> 00:04:23,573
"Sapphire is a girl"

53
00:04:23,621 --> 00:04:25,816
But I didn't write
that I am a girl!

54
00:04:27,021 --> 00:04:29,012
The sentence changed by itself.

55
00:04:29,061 --> 00:04:31,655
Sapphire, that pen, in reality,
is a magic pen.

56
00:04:31,701 --> 00:04:34,534
You cannot write
false things with this pen.

57
00:04:34,581 --> 00:04:37,573
No matter how well one can lie,
the pen writes the truth.

58
00:04:38,101 --> 00:04:40,490
You know, Sapphire,
I like you a lot.

59
00:04:40,741 --> 00:04:42,618
And you are also very kind.

60
00:04:42,901 --> 00:04:45,813
Not only are you kind,
but you are also very generous

61
00:04:45,861 --> 00:04:49,490
...and you go out of your way for your friends:
you have great goodness of heart.

62
00:04:49,901 --> 00:04:52,654
Now, Sapphire, I would like to ask
of your generosity...

63
00:04:52,701 --> 00:04:55,056
...a big favor:
can you give the magic pen..

64
00:04:55,101 --> 00:04:57,569
...to that girl
with the long, brown hair?

65
00:04:57,621 --> 00:05:00,294
You know, the one I met
at that carnival party...

66
00:05:00,341 --> 00:05:02,696
...and with whom I danced
the whole evening!

67
00:05:04,421 --> 00:05:07,015
Why do you want me to give the pen
to that girl?

68
00:05:07,141 --> 00:05:10,258
I would like to know what she thinks of me.
I can't forget her.

69
00:05:17,901 --> 00:05:20,461
I will never forget
that time I danced...

70
00:05:20,501 --> 00:05:22,696
..with that girl
with long hair.

71
00:05:22,901 --> 00:05:27,292
Oh, Franco! I wish I could tell you that
in reality that girl is me.

72
00:05:31,821 --> 00:05:33,891
Please, Sapphire,
search in your kingdom..

73
00:05:33,941 --> 00:05:36,011
...the girl
with long brown hair

74
00:05:36,061 --> 00:05:38,894
...and tell her to write me
a letter with this pen.

75
00:05:39,101 --> 00:05:41,490
You could go ask him
yourself.

76
00:05:41,621 --> 00:05:44,852
No, I can't. My father
almost never lets me go out.

77
00:05:44,901 --> 00:05:47,017
Today I snuck out.

78
00:05:47,181 --> 00:05:49,012
Prince Franz!

79
00:05:53,661 --> 00:05:56,414
Your father noticed
that you weren't at the castle...

80
00:05:56,461 --> 00:05:59,021
...and ordered us to search for you.
Please, Your Highness,

81
00:05:59,061 --> 00:06:02,098
return to the castle now,
your father will be furious.

82
00:06:02,141 --> 00:06:04,814
I had something to do,
that's why I went out.

83
00:06:04,861 --> 00:06:07,933
So, Sapphire, please,
do what I told you.

84
00:06:07,981 --> 00:06:09,733
Goodbye!

85
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:44,576
Welcome back to the castle, Prince!

86
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:47,215
But where are you?
Have you hidden yourself?

87
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:49,331
You don't want to be found, eh?

88
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:52,418
I get it:
you are in the secret room!

89
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:55,214
You want to wear a dress
as a girl today, right?

90
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:58,139
It's natural,
since in reality you are!

91
00:07:03,060 --> 00:07:05,734
I wonder if Franco, one day,
will understand the truth...!

92
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:11,731
Now I'll have to write him a letter

93
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:16,340
"I am the girl
with long brown hair"

94
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:19,533
Strange, the pen moved
by itself! Let's see what it wrote.

95
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:23,011
"The true identity of the girl
with brown hair is Sapphire.

96
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:26,895
" Oh, no! I can't send
him a letter like that!

97
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:29,774
Good grief, this really is
a magic pen!

98
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:35,136
It makes people express
what they really think.

99
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:43,818
Here is my nursemaid!

100
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:50,214
Hey!

101
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:55,173
Have you pulled another
of your tricks? What is this?

102
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:58,299
Try writing
everything you think of me.

103
00:07:58,340 --> 00:08:00,013
Here!

104
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:04,291
"Prince Sapphire is always so
mischievous and impertinent...

105
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:06,809
...that sometimes I
hate him!" There you go!

106
00:08:07,540 --> 00:08:10,817
"I hope Prince Sapphire
will grow up healthy."

107
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:15,098
Thank you very much, nurse!

108
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,739
What?!

109
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:24,375
You must write
what you think of me.

110
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:27,535
Yes, sir! "Prince Sapphire
is a wonderful Prince,

111
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:30,539
like no other in the whole
world! Long live Prince Sapphire!

112
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:33,015
Long live the Prince of Silverland!"

113
00:08:33,060 --> 00:08:36,212
"Now I would like a hot chocolate,
an orange soda, and an ice cream."

114
00:08:38,900 --> 00:08:40,653
You're very hungry, aren't you?

115
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:42,739
Who will be next?

116
00:08:43,780 --> 00:08:45,419
Oh, I'm so sorry!

117
00:08:45,901 --> 00:08:47,812
Good heavens, Prince Sapphire!

118
00:08:47,861 --> 00:08:49,658
We must be considerate
of animals!

119
00:08:49,701 --> 00:08:51,737
Look how beautiful
this bird is.

120
00:08:51,781 --> 00:08:53,612
It doesn't deserve
to be harmed.

121
00:08:53,661 --> 00:08:56,016
You are right! So as not to forget
your words,

122
00:08:56,061 --> 00:08:58,336
- please write them here
- Of course, Prince!

123
00:08:58,381 --> 00:09:01,498
Now then... "We must not
harm animals."

124
00:09:01,541 --> 00:09:03,133
There we go!

125
00:09:08,221 --> 00:09:10,098
"I will kill this peacock..

126
00:09:10,141 --> 00:09:13,019
...and decorate the hut
with its feathers"? That's impossible!

127
00:09:13,061 --> 00:09:15,017
But how did I manage
to write this?!

128
00:09:17,581 --> 00:09:20,812
Knowing the truth from
people is very interesting.

129
00:09:21,621 --> 00:09:25,250
Yes, because many people
are so sly...

130
00:09:26,261 --> 00:09:29,458
Here is Neelon! I would
like to know what he thinks!

131
00:09:31,181 --> 00:09:33,900
Good morning, Prince!
What can I do for you?

132
00:09:33,941 --> 00:09:36,011
What do you think of when you see me?

133
00:09:36,061 --> 00:09:39,019
What do I think of you? That I
am happy to see you doing well...

134
00:09:39,061 --> 00:09:42,098
...and to see you grow strong and
healthy, because you must become King.

135
00:09:42,301 --> 00:09:45,737
Thank you, Neelon, but now
write these words up here.

136
00:09:46,021 --> 00:09:48,854
I will do as you wish! I will write down
for you everything that is on my mind.

137
00:09:48,901 --> 00:09:51,210
Come here, you big peacock! Stop!

138
00:09:51,261 --> 00:09:54,810
I need your feathers
for my hairstyle! Stop!

139
00:09:55,101 --> 00:09:57,820
Honestly! Stop

140
00:09:57,901 --> 00:10:00,620
Oh, excuse me, Prince Sapphire!
Excuse me!

141
00:10:04,581 --> 00:10:06,378
What is going on?

142
00:10:06,421 --> 00:10:08,298
"I am sure that Sapphire
is a girl.

143
00:10:08,341 --> 00:10:10,059
One day I will find out the truth"

144
00:10:10,101 --> 00:10:12,410
I didn't write
such a terrible thing!

145
00:10:12,461 --> 00:10:16,295
"Tonight, at midnight"... Here
you stopped writing, Neelon.

146
00:10:16,661 --> 00:10:20,290
- Well, I...
- What do you want to do at midnight?

147
00:10:20,341 --> 00:10:22,013
Come on, tell me!

148
00:10:22,061 --> 00:10:24,097
I don't know! Let me go!
I don't know anything!

149
00:10:24,141 --> 00:10:25,733
Wait!

150
00:10:26,141 --> 00:10:29,497
- Wait for me! Wait!
- No! No, I'm not waiting for you! No!

151
00:10:31,141 --> 00:10:33,211
I told you to wait!

152
00:10:37,301 --> 00:10:39,098
Will you stop?!

153
00:10:39,741 --> 00:10:41,333
Where are you going?

154
00:10:43,021 --> 00:10:46,696
Fortunately I didn't write
what will happen at midnight!

155
00:10:56,661 --> 00:10:59,016
Welcome, Prince Sapphire!

156
00:10:59,461 --> 00:11:03,454
Grand Duke Geralamon, what are you to do
tonight, at midnight?

157
00:11:03,501 --> 00:11:05,332
Write the answer up here!

158
00:11:05,381 --> 00:11:08,134
Excuse me, Prince, I prefer
to answer in words.

159
00:11:08,181 --> 00:11:10,934
With words, it's easier
to lie. Write it down!

160
00:11:10,981 --> 00:11:13,575
I really can't.
See? My hand is injured.

161
00:11:13,621 --> 00:11:15,418
Write with your left hand.

162
00:11:15,461 --> 00:11:18,737
My left hand is injured too, so
there is no other solution left...

163
00:11:18,781 --> 00:11:21,420
...but to talk about it.
- I won't listen to your lies.

164
00:11:21,461 --> 00:11:23,338
See you later, Grand Duke!

165
00:11:27,061 --> 00:11:30,451
You did well, because that
magic pen is truly terrible!

166
00:11:30,501 --> 00:11:32,219
No, that pen is wonderful!

167
00:11:32,261 --> 00:11:34,570
With it, not even Sapphire
will be able to write a lie.

168
00:11:34,621 --> 00:11:38,250
You'll see: I will manage to make
him write that, in reality, he is a girl.

169
00:11:38,301 --> 00:11:40,656
I understand! That
seems like a great idea!

170
00:11:40,701 --> 00:11:43,261
Anyway, what do we do
with tonight's plan?

171
00:11:43,501 --> 00:11:46,379
The plan? We'll carry it out!

172
00:11:46,661 --> 00:11:48,299
It will be interesting!

173
00:12:06,701 --> 00:12:08,737
There's an hour left until midnight.

174
00:12:14,181 --> 00:12:16,411
I hope I can manage to stay awake.

175
00:12:27,101 --> 00:12:29,251
I thought I heard a noise!

176
00:12:33,061 --> 00:12:35,336
My eyes are closing.

177
00:12:49,901 --> 00:12:52,779
I fell asleep!
But this is a fire!

178
00:12:55,421 --> 00:12:57,218
It won't open!

179
00:12:58,021 --> 00:13:00,615
I have to open it somehow!

180
00:13:02,621 --> 00:13:04,737
Help! There's a fire!

181
00:13:04,781 --> 00:13:07,932
With the firefighters
the flames don't last long!

182
00:13:07,981 --> 00:13:09,972
It seems like they
were waiting for the fire.

183
00:13:10,021 --> 00:13:13,093
Fire, we do not fear
you! We master the fires!

184
00:13:15,301 --> 00:13:17,656
What are you doing?!
Throw some water on it!

185
00:13:17,701 --> 00:13:19,692
- Don't worry!
- You give us the job!

186
00:13:19,741 --> 00:13:21,572
And we put out the fire!

187
00:13:22,021 --> 00:13:25,172
They don't have water with them
and they are pretending to be busy.

188
00:13:27,141 --> 00:13:29,018
With us, the fire doesn't last long!

189
00:13:29,061 --> 00:13:31,734
Without water,
you can't be firefighters!

190
00:13:32,021 --> 00:13:35,013
Prince, remember: if you
obstruct us, you will be punished!

191
00:13:35,061 --> 00:13:38,371
Scoundrels! I have realized
that you are fake firefighters!

192
00:13:38,421 --> 00:13:41,618
If you don't let us work, you
will see the castle in ashes!

193
00:13:43,821 --> 00:13:45,698
The fire is growing!

194
00:13:45,741 --> 00:13:47,811
And now...

195
00:13:47,861 --> 00:13:49,817
That's enough! Go away!

196
00:13:49,861 --> 00:13:52,898
Prince, leave it alone!
This could split your head open!

197
00:13:53,781 --> 00:13:56,818
Scoundrels! It was you
who set fire to the castle!

198
00:13:58,741 --> 00:14:01,335
You did it on purpose, didn't you?

199
00:14:11,901 --> 00:14:14,131
Help! Fire!

200
00:14:15,581 --> 00:14:18,459
I'm coming with water!

201
00:14:20,821 --> 00:14:22,618
Will I tame the fire?

202
00:14:23,021 --> 00:14:27,253
Come on, pump the water!
Come on! Here it is, finally!

203
00:14:36,141 --> 00:14:37,779
Here it is, Your Highness!

204
00:14:38,461 --> 00:14:40,213
Thank you, Garigori.

205
00:14:40,501 --> 00:14:42,139
What is it?

206
00:14:43,541 --> 00:14:46,578
Don't run away! Stop!

207
00:14:46,621 --> 00:14:49,818
- Let me go, Prince!
- If you tell me who sent you!

208
00:14:49,861 --> 00:14:54,412
I can't say! Give me paper
and a pen and I will write his name!

209
00:14:54,461 --> 00:14:56,531
I'll give him the magic pen..

210
00:15:00,501 --> 00:15:02,731
Here is pen and paper! Now write!

211
00:15:03,461 --> 00:15:07,010
I've got it!
I took the magic pen!

212
00:15:07,781 --> 00:15:09,260
Stop!

213
00:15:17,101 --> 00:15:19,820
You did well!
Sometimes you are useful.

214
00:15:19,861 --> 00:15:22,250
Thank you!

215
00:15:22,301 --> 00:15:24,098
Now we have Sapphire in our grasp

216
00:15:24,141 --> 00:15:27,770
I will not fail to discover her
secret. Very well! Very well!

217
00:15:28,821 --> 00:15:31,733
This time, dear Prince,
it's over for you.

218
00:15:47,101 --> 00:15:49,092
Choppy! Where am I?

219
00:15:49,181 --> 00:15:51,012
This is Garigori's room.

220
00:15:51,061 --> 00:15:54,531
First I came to you and saw
that you were fighting with three fake firefighters.

221
00:15:54,581 --> 00:15:56,776
Then you fainted,
so I brought you here

222
00:15:56,821 --> 00:15:59,016
And so you took care of me?

223
00:15:59,061 --> 00:16:00,813
Yes.

224
00:16:03,021 --> 00:16:07,173
Thank you, Choppy. I wonder if
my secret room is safe..!

225
00:16:07,901 --> 00:16:10,574
Yes, it is safe, don't worry.
No one will find it.

226
00:16:10,621 --> 00:16:13,089
- I'm sleepy..
- Damn, the pen!

227
00:16:14,381 --> 00:16:16,099
Where could that thief have gone?

228
00:16:16,141 --> 00:16:19,292
Sapphire, where is the pen? You kept
Franco's pen, right?

229
00:16:19,541 --> 00:16:23,580
Yes, I had it, but I lost it
last night, during the fire.

230
00:16:25,061 --> 00:16:27,814
A real mess...
I absolutely must find it!

231
00:16:27,861 --> 00:16:29,579
What's going on?

232
00:16:31,101 --> 00:16:34,298
Where could they be taking
all these tables and chairs?

233
00:16:41,941 --> 00:16:43,818
But Prince!

234
00:16:44,021 --> 00:16:46,819
Excuse me, may I know
what you are preparing?

235
00:16:46,861 --> 00:16:49,421
Your Highness, I don't know the
details, but I heard that this stuff...

236
00:16:49,461 --> 00:16:51,452
...is for the ceremony
of your oath.

237
00:16:51,501 --> 00:16:53,571
My oath?! But what ceremony
are you talking about?

238
00:16:53,621 --> 00:16:55,259
Oh, I don't know, sir.

239
00:16:55,301 --> 00:16:58,134
Well, I really don't know
what it is about, Prince,

240
00:16:58,181 --> 00:17:02,094
but I know that the senior members
of the Council have been summoned,

241
00:17:02,141 --> 00:17:04,814
so it must certainly be
something important,

242
00:17:04,861 --> 00:17:07,500
even though I don't have the slightest idea
of what is brewing...

243
00:17:07,541 --> 00:17:09,532
and I'd really like to know.

244
00:17:11,141 --> 00:17:13,894
Prince Sapphire! The Grand Duke
and the members of the Council...

245
00:17:13,941 --> 00:17:16,409
...are waiting for you
in the ceremony hall.

246
00:17:16,461 --> 00:17:18,213
Really? For what?

247
00:17:18,261 --> 00:17:20,252
He only told me
to accompany you there

248
00:17:20,621 --> 00:17:22,657
I see.
I'm coming right away.

249
00:17:30,781 --> 00:17:33,534
Welcome to the Council Chamber,
Prince.

250
00:17:33,581 --> 00:17:35,617
What does this ceremony mean?

251
00:17:35,661 --> 00:17:38,733
And also, I would like you to explain to me
why I must take an oath!

252
00:17:39,461 --> 00:17:43,010
You see, someone has doubts
about your identity, and so...

253
00:17:43,061 --> 00:17:45,416
It's a very simple ceremony,
Your Highness.

254
00:17:45,461 --> 00:17:48,259
- And what should I do?
- It's very simple:

255
00:17:48,301 --> 00:17:50,257
you only have to write
on this paper...

256
00:17:50,301 --> 00:17:52,451
...that you swear to be
the Prince of this kingdom...

257
00:17:52,501 --> 00:17:55,379
...and that you will always behave
like a true Prince. That's all.

258
00:17:55,421 --> 00:17:57,810
Now we will give you the pen
to write these things.

259
00:18:01,021 --> 00:18:03,615
- It's the magic pen!
- What is the matter, Your Highness?

260
00:18:03,661 --> 00:18:06,937
I will not write that oath!
I have no intention of doing so!

261
00:18:07,821 --> 00:18:10,779
Prince, His Majesty the King
has approved this oath.

262
00:18:10,821 --> 00:18:13,335
..and has affixed the seal
of his consent!

263
00:18:13,381 --> 00:18:17,340
Even if you do not want to, we will make you
do it against your will.

264
00:18:25,421 --> 00:18:27,537
So, are you determined to write
that sentence?

265
00:18:27,581 --> 00:18:29,572
No, I will not write with that pen

266
00:18:29,621 --> 00:18:32,340
otherwise I would write
that Sapphire is a girl

267
00:18:34,021 --> 00:18:36,012
Wait,
consult Prince Franz.

268
00:18:36,061 --> 00:18:38,336
- He might have some idea.
- Too late.

269
00:18:41,021 --> 00:18:43,899
Still, it's worth a try!
I'm rushing to his palace!

270
00:18:44,501 --> 00:18:46,731
Wait, Choppy! It's no use!

271
00:18:46,901 --> 00:18:48,812
He won't make it in time.

272
00:18:58,901 --> 00:19:01,051
The ceremony will begin in an hour.

273
00:19:16,901 --> 00:19:20,018
- The ceremony begins.
- Get out of the way!

274
00:19:20,141 --> 00:19:22,132
Prince, the time has come!

275
00:19:22,181 --> 00:19:24,217
Follow me
to the Hall of Ceremonies!

276
00:19:40,741 --> 00:19:44,575
Prince, please, sit down
on that chair, please.

277
00:19:45,141 --> 00:19:46,813
No!

278
00:19:52,821 --> 00:19:54,732
Sapphire, what's wrong?

279
00:19:54,781 --> 00:19:57,500
You shouldn't refuse
to go to write this oath.

280
00:19:57,581 --> 00:20:00,857
- Excuse me, but...
- What is happening, Your Highness?

281
00:20:00,901 --> 00:20:03,210
You seem extremely embarrassed.

282
00:20:03,901 --> 00:20:06,461
Sapphire,
go and sit down immediately

283
00:20:11,901 --> 00:20:14,335
Have you made up your mind? Here is the pen

284
00:20:21,261 --> 00:20:24,810
What can be done? Sapphire must
write the oath immediately.

285
00:20:24,901 --> 00:20:28,610
Sapphire, you cannot back out.
You must sign in front of everyone.

286
00:20:28,661 --> 00:20:30,219
Oh, no!

287
00:20:38,501 --> 00:20:40,412
Faster, eagles!
Faster!

288
00:20:40,621 --> 00:20:42,452
Fly faster!

289
00:20:42,501 --> 00:20:44,856
Let's hurry!
There's no time to lose!

290
00:20:47,821 --> 00:20:49,812
There it is, the castle!

291
00:20:49,861 --> 00:20:52,170
Eagles,
fly towards that window!

292
00:20:54,741 --> 00:20:57,414
Choppy, jump! Come on!

293
00:20:59,421 --> 00:21:02,015
Please, eagles,
get closer!

294
00:21:04,461 --> 00:21:07,021
Well, make up your mind,
Prince Sapphire?

295
00:21:07,061 --> 00:21:09,450
Do you have any reason
to refuse to write?

296
00:21:09,501 --> 00:21:12,937
If you really are not a girl,
you have no reason to hesitate.

297
00:21:26,461 --> 00:21:28,691
Sapphire has already taken
that pen in hand!

298
00:21:28,741 --> 00:21:30,697
- What?! She's lost!
- Not yet,

299
00:21:30,741 --> 00:21:32,697
if you quickly come up with
some good idea!

300
00:21:32,741 --> 00:21:35,016
We must try to save him
at all costs!

301
00:21:35,061 --> 00:21:38,019
I can't think of any ideas,
but if I could manage to drop in there...

302
00:21:38,061 --> 00:21:39,619
Yes, do it, please!

303
00:21:42,741 --> 00:21:46,017
- Wait!
- Where is this troublemaker?

304
00:21:47,541 --> 00:21:49,372
Cut, Choppy!

305
00:21:58,181 --> 00:21:59,819
Franco!

306
00:21:59,861 --> 00:22:02,933
My name is Franco! I travel around the
entire world to fight!

307
00:22:02,981 --> 00:22:06,530
I came here to measure myself
against Prince Sapphire,

308
00:22:06,581 --> 00:22:09,300
- given his fame!
- Damn troublemaker!

309
00:22:09,341 --> 00:22:11,218
Soldiers, arrest that man!

310
00:22:18,261 --> 00:22:21,776
- Come on, Sapphire!
- All right, Franco! Here I am!

311
00:22:22,021 --> 00:22:25,252
Anyone who interrupts this
fight will be punished!

312
00:22:25,301 --> 00:22:27,815
Damned boy! Did he
have to arrive right now?

313
00:22:27,861 --> 00:22:29,658
On guard, Franco!

314
00:22:32,581 --> 00:22:35,857
- How are you, Princess?
- I am very grateful to you, Franco.

315
00:22:36,381 --> 00:22:39,020
- To you!
- Well done!

316
00:22:43,461 --> 00:22:46,533
Follow me, quickly! Let's
go! Pretend to chase me!

317
00:23:00,061 --> 00:23:01,813
Wait!

318
00:23:06,581 --> 00:23:08,811
Take this! Take this!

319
00:23:17,021 --> 00:23:20,650
Well done! Hooray!
Now Sapphire is safe!

320
00:23:20,821 --> 00:23:23,540
I can sleep peacefully!

321
00:23:45,101 --> 00:23:48,411
I was very worried about
what could happen to me.

322
00:23:48,461 --> 00:23:52,010
I'm really sorry. From now on,
I won't use this pen anymore.

323
00:23:52,181 --> 00:23:54,900
Franco, I think there
is a big difference...

324
00:23:54,941 --> 00:23:57,216
...between what is said
and what is thought.

325
00:23:57,341 --> 00:24:00,492
Yeah. I wonder if the girl
with the brown hair...

326
00:24:00,541 --> 00:24:02,532
...will tell me the truth...

327
00:24:02,701 --> 00:24:04,931
I really think she will tell you.

328
00:24:04,981 --> 00:24:07,495
I am certain
that you will meet again soon

329
00:24:08,301 --> 00:24:11,577
What?! Is it true? Seriously?

330
00:24:12,861 --> 00:24:15,500
He still doesn't realize
the truth.

331
00:24:39,021 --> 00:24:42,641
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

332
00:24:42,642 --> 00:24:46,002
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

333
00:24:46,003 --> 00:24:49,773
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

334
00:24:49,774 --> 00:24:52,935
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

335
00:24:52,936 --> 00:24:56,749
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

336
00:24:56,750 --> 00:25:00,046
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

337
00:25:00,047 --> 00:25:04,052
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

338
00:25:04,053 --> 00:25:07,491
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

339
00:25:07,492 --> 00:25:11,112
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
